  "draft_py": "# Angelic Gift: s3 \"Enchanted creature has flying.\" (the B9-equipped-keyword /\n# Rousing Read grant shape). Printed order: ETB draw (compiled[0]), the grant,\n# then the Aura's cast carrier (compiled[1]).\ngrant = StaticAbility(\n    effect=A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n        'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.FLYING),\n        'target': Selector(\n            count=QUnbounded(),\n            mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n            filter=FAnd(children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACHED_TO_SOURCE),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            )),\n            zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n        ),\n    }),\n)\nabilities = [compiled[0], grant, compiled[1]]\n",
